      "text": "03-03-2026\n\n🚨 Traffic Advisory | Karuma Bridge, along Kampala–Gulu Highway.\n\nThe Uganda Police team operating along the Karuma Bridge area has informed us of a planned exercise tomorrow to retrieve an overturned trailer at Karuma Bridge between 9:00am to 12:00pm.\n\n#DURATION: The exercise is expected to last approximately 03 hours or less. \n\n#DELAYS: Traffic delays and temporary inconvenience expected during this period.\n\n#ADVISORY: Motorists are advised to;\n• Plan their journey accordingly\n• Allow for extra travel time\n• Strictly follow Traffic Police guidance on site\n• Approach the area with caution\n\nWe appreciate your patience as the teams work to restore full and safe traffic flow.",
